  "prefLabel": "Rev 2908.06 Making Installment Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2908.06 Making Installment Payments. When a taxpayer remits an installment payment pursuant to an installment payment agreement, the taxpayer shall:\n\n(a) Remit the installment payment electronically pursuant to Rev 2500; or\n\n(b) Remit the installment payment to the department accompanied by the Payment Voucher form.\n\nSource. #10680, eff 10-2-14; ss by #13126-B, eff 10-24-20; ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
